<title>MALAYSIA: CRICKET-KENYA 241-7 V BANGLADESH IN ICC TROPHY FINAL.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-KENYA 241-7 V BANGLADESH IN ICC TROPHY FINAL.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kenya was 241 for seven wickets at the end of their innings against Bangladesh in the final of the International Cricket Council (ICC) Trophy on Saturday.</p>
<p>Play for the day was then stopped by the umpires because of rain and will resume on Sunday.</p>
<p>Scores: Kenya 241-7 innings closed (Steve Tikolo 147; Mohammed Rafique 3-40) v Bangladesh.</p>
</text>
